  "title": "Oklahoma Lottery Results and Winning Numbers",
  "contentHtml": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1299\" class=\"elementor elementor-1299\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1aea1e43 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"25949\" data-id=\"1aea1e43\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c1e8e1\" data-eae-slider=\"42488\" data-id=\"c1e8e1\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-75303625 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"75303625\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2> </h2><h2>Oklahoma Lottery Games</h2><div> </div>\n<table id=\"tablepress-OpeningHours-no-2\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-OpeningHours tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Game</th><th class=\"column-2\">Prize Type</th><th class=\"column-3\">Numbers</th><th class=\"column-4\">Sale Closes</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3</td><td class=\"column-2\">Top Prize</td><td class=\"column-3\">3 from 0-9</td><td class=\"column-4\">8:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 5</td><td class=\"column-2\">Top Prize</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-36</td><td class=\"column-4\">8:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-4\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Powerball</td><td class=\"column-2\">Jackpot</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-69 + 1 from 1-26</td><td class=\"column-4\">8:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-5\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Mega Millions</td><td class=\"column-2\">Jackpot</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-70 + 1 from 1-25</td><td class=\"column-4\">8:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-6\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Lotto America</td><td class=\"column-2\">Jackpot</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-52 + 1 from 1-10</td><td class=\"column-4\">8:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-7\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Lucky for Life</td><td class=\"column-2\">Top Prize</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-48 + 1 from 1-18</td><td class=\"column-4\">8:30 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2> </h2><h2>Game Schedule</h2><div> </div><div id=\"tablepress-ImportIODrawScheudule-no-2-scroll-wrapper\" class=\"tablepress-scroll-wrapper\">\n\n<table id=\"tablepress-ImportIODrawScheudule-no-2\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-ImportIODrawScheudule tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Game</th><th class=\"column-2\">Sunday</th><th class=\"column-3\">Monday</th><th class=\"column-4\">Tuesday</th><th class=\"column-5\">Wednesday</th><th class=\"column-6\">Thursday</th><th class=\"column-7\">Friday</th><th class=\"column-8\">Saturday</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3</td><td class=\"column-2\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">9:00 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 5</td><td class=\"column-2\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">9:00 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-4\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Powerball</td><td class=\"column-2\"></td><td class=\"column-3\"></td><td class=\"column-4\"></td><td class=\"column-5\">9:59 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\"></td><td class=\"column-7\"></td><td class=\"column-8\">9:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-5\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Mega Millions</td><td class=\"column-2\"></td><td class=\"column-3\"></td><td class=\"column-4\">10:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\"></td><td class=\"column-6\"></td><td class=\"column-7\">10:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-6\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Lotto America</td><td class=\"column-2\"></td><td class=\"column-3\"></td><td class=\"column-4\"></td><td class=\"column-5\">10:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\"></td><td class=\"column-7\"></td><td class=\"column-8\">10:00 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-7\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Lucky for Life</td><td class=\"column-2\"></td><td class=\"column-3\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\"></td><td class=\"column-5\"></td><td class=\"column-6\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\"></td><td class=\"column-8\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</div><p>*All times are displayed in Oklahoma local time.</p><h2> </h2><h2> </h2><h2>Advance Draws</h2><p>N<span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Archivo; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); font-size: 1rem;\">umber of consecutive draws each Oklahoma State Lottery games allows you to play:</span></p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-AdvancedDraws-no-2\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-AdvancedDraws tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Game</th><th class=\"column-2\">Advanced Draws</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 5</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-4\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Powerball</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-5\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Mega Millions</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-6\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Lotto America</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-7\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Lucky for Life</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2> </h2><h2>Oklahoma Lottery Tax Information</h2><p>Oklahoma Lottery Federal, and state tax withholdings on winnings for U.S. citizens or residents. </p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-USResidentsTax-no-2\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-USResidentsTax tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Winnings</th><th class=\"column-2\">Tax Category</th><th class=\"column-3\">Percentage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">State Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">4.0%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">Federal Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">24.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>If the winner is not a U.S. citizen or is not a US resident, Oklahoma Lottery tax withholdings on winnings are as such:  </p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-NonUSTax-no-2\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-NonUSTax tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Winnings</th><th class=\"column-2\">Tax Category</th><th class=\"column-3\">Percentage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $600</td><td class=\"column-2\">State Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">8.0%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $600</td><td class=\"column-2\">Federal Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">30.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<figure></figure><figure></figure><figure><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter\" src=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Oklahoma.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" srcset=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Oklahoma.jpg 894w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Oklahoma-300x143.jpg 300w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Oklahoma-768x367.jpg 768w\" alt=\"Oklahoma lottery\" width=\"800\" height=\"382\" /><figcaption></figcaption></figure><figure></figure><h2> </h2><h2>Oklahoma Lottery</h2><div> </div><div><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Oklahoma is right in the middle of the tornado corridor, which means a lot of strong wind blows your way when you live there. You best be prepared for it, they say, and do what you can to have the winds blow in your favor. The Oklahoma State Lottery plays its part in helping out. Oklahomans have won some $129 million worth of prizes since 2005. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Proceeds from ticket sales go to the Oklahoma Education Lottery Trust Fund. Dozens of Oklahoma State Lottery winners have been produced throughout its existence, including a few multi-millionaires. Perhaps the luckiest of those Okies, as they like to call themselves, was Don and Joyce Harvey, who won $106 million off Powerball back in 2007. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Powerball and Oklahoma lottery Mega Millions are the most popular games in the state, followed by such favorites as Lotto America, Lucky for Life, Pick 3, and Cash 5. Oklahoma lottery tickets can be purchased from any participating retail outlet across the state. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The lottery in Oklahoma has over 1800 retail partners, who contributed to sales of more than $242.5 million. In 2019, more than $15.2 million in commission was paid out to retailers for ticket sales and cash-ins.</span><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Archivo; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); font-size: 1rem;\"> </span></p></div><div> </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c58a210 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"49990\" data-id=\"c58a210\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1e2f762\" data-eae-slider=\"40079\" data-id=\"1e2f762\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cadcb45 elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"cadcb45\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t            <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-cadcb45\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"cadcb45\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n            <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-are-the-requirements-to-buy-lottery-tickets-in-oklahoma\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2121\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Are the Requirements to Buy Lottery Tickets in Oklahoma?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2121\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"what-are-the-requirements-to-buy-lottery-tickets-in-oklahoma\"><p>Persons must be 18 or older to play. Oklahoma lottery tickets can be bought from authorized retailers all over the state. No online ticket sales are possible. An Oklahoma lottery app is available, but its functionality is limited to checking Oklahoma lottery results, generating random numbers, and checking your numbers.</p><p> </p><p>The app is not an Oklahoma lottery ticket scanner for checking draw or scratch tickets or Oklahoma lottery codes.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-lottery-games-can-you-play-in-oklahoma\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2122\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Lottery Games Can You Play in Oklahoma?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2122\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"what-lottery-games-can-you-play-in-oklahoma\"><p>The lottery in Oklahoma offers six different games. In addition to Mega Millions and Oklahoma lottery Powerball, you can play Oklahoma Lottery</p><p>Lucky for Life.</p><p>The following games are available to Okies as well:</p><p>Lotto America – features a rolling jackpot that starts at $2 million</p><p>Pick 3 – Pick three single-digit numbers and choose from multiple ways to win</p><p>Cash 5 – Choose five numbers from 1 to 36 and attempt to win $25 000</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"where-and-how-do-i-claim-winnings-from-the-oklahoma-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2123\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Where and How Do I Claim Winnings from the Oklahoma Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2123\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"where-and-how-do-i-claim-winnings-from-the-oklahoma-lottery\"><p>If you matched the Oklahoma lottery numbers, you could redeem your tickets at the Oklahoma Lottery’s office in Oklahoma City or any of the twelve claim centres across the state. You can claim prizes of $600 or less from your local participating retailer.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-do-you-play-and-win-in-the-oklahoma-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2124\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How Do You Play and Win in the Oklahoma Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2124\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-labelledby=\"how-do-you-play-and-win-in-the-oklahoma-lottery\"><p>Each of the six lottery games has a specific range of Oklahoma Lottery numbers. For instance, Cash 5 lets you pick five numbers between 1 and 36. The aim is to correctly guess which of these five numbers will appear in the draw. You can also win a cash prize for as little as two matching Oklahoma Lottery winning numbers.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-are-the-odds-of-winning-the-oklahoma-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2125\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Are the Odds of Winning the Oklahoma Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2125\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-labelledby=\"what-are-the-odds-of-winning-the-oklahoma-lottery\"><p>The odds of winning the various games available from the Oklahoma State Lottery are as follows:</p><p>Mega Millions: 1 in 302 million</p><p>Powerball: 1 in 175 million</p><p>Lucky for Life: 1 in 31 million</p><p>Lotto America: 1 in 26 million</p><p>Pick 3: 1 in 1000</p><p>Cash 5: 1 in 377 000</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"whats-the-biggest-oklahoma-lottery-win\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2126\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What’s the Biggest Oklahoma Lottery Win?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2126\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-labelledby=\"whats-the-biggest-oklahoma-lottery-win\"><p>The biggest Oklahoma Lottery winners hit the Powerball jackpot in 2007 when Don and Joyce Harvey won $106 million.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"when-is-the-oklahoma-lottery-results-draw\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2127\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">When Is the Oklahoma Lottery Results Draw?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2127\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"when-is-the-oklahoma-lottery-results-draw\"><p>You can view the draw results of the Oklahoma Lottery games at the following times:</p><p>Lotto America: Wednesdays and Saturdays at 10 pm</p><p>Lucky for Life: Mondays and Thursdays at 9 pm</p><p>Pick 3 and Cash 5: Daily at 9 pm</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-is-the-oklahoma-lottery-second-chance\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2128\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Is the Oklahoma Lottery Second Chance?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2128\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-labelledby=\"what-is-the-oklahoma-lottery-second-chance\"><p>Oklahoma state lottery offers promotional Oklahoma lottery second chance drawings on Oklahoma lottery scratch games. Players need to register on the official lottery website in order to participate. Once a player has an account, eligible tickets can be entered for prizes like cash, merchandise, and vacations</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"do-i-have-to-pay-tax-on-oklahoma-lottery-winnings\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"9\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2129\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Do I Have to Pay Tax on Oklahoma Lottery Winnings?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2129\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"9\" aria-labelledby=\"do-i-have-to-pay-tax-on-oklahoma-lottery-winnings\"><p>Yes. If you win more than $600, then the Oklahoma Lottery will keep a specific percentage of these winnings for federal and state tax purposes as follows:</p><p> </p><p>State tax is 4%</p><p>Federal tax is 24%</p><p>Total tax is 28.%</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3943a16 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"51500\" data-id=\"3943a16\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-94f299d\" data-eae-slider=\"18694\" data-id=\"94f299d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34729af elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"34729af\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Got more questions about the Oklahoma Lottery? </p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-048cb95\" data-eae-slider=\"24306\" data-id=\"048cb95\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6fbb789 elementor-button-success elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"6fbb789\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e